### 2. Find user by id
#### Request
GET {{url}}/auth/1

### 3. Find user by email
#### Request
GET {{url}}/auth?email=john.doe@gmail.com

### 4. Delete user
#### Request
DELETE {{url}}/auth/2

### 5. Update user
